
<p>Austin Mann:</p>

<blockquote>
  <p>I’m here at the beautiful <a href="https://www.bydunton.com/destinations/rivercamp">Dunton River Camp</a> in southwest
Colorado, where I’ve spent the last week testing the new camera
and features on the iPhone 18 Pro.</p>

<p>Beyond the variable aperture and Pro Controls, Apple also built in
a bunch of other new features like Photographic Styles 3 with film
texture and grain control, 4K Time-lapse and Focus Tracking. As
